 "remarks": "FOR SALE OR LEASE. ALSO AVAILABLE FOR RENT AT $15,000/MONTH.Tucked away on a private cul-de-sac in Wilton's sought-after Keelers Ridge neighborhood, this exceptionally maintained estate spans 2.28 acres of professionally landscaped grounds. Offering over 9,100+ sq. ft. of total finished space across the main residence and heated/cooled pool house, the property enjoys complete privacy and ideal positioning for both morning sunrises and evening sunsets. 9,100+ Sq Ft...Main House 6,115 sq. ft. Lower Level is finished with 1,995 sq. ft. and Pool House 1031 sq. ft. The main residence features 5 bedrooms, 4 full and 3 half baths, including a convenient main-level bedroom suite. The finished lower level adds dedicated space for a wine cellar, gym, rec room, plus 1,040 sq. ft. of unfinished basement for storage and utilities. A whole-house Crestron sound system (Sonos compatible) runs throughout. Designed for effortless indoor-outdoor entertaining, two expansive stone patios-each equipped with its own outdoor kitchen-overlook the gardens, newly built cedar pergolas, and heated pool with spa. Topped with a classic cupola, the pool house includes central HVAC, a full bath, kitchenette, and a 740 sq. ft. unfinished basement-ideal for poolside hosting and relaxation. Major mechanicals and upgrades: new roof, gutters and downspout (2026), new HVAC system (2024), whole-house generator (2021/22).",
